 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"Well now — Are you going to stay? With us. For real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "Something eases in their shoulders. \"Good. We're better with you here. I mean that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"Still on whether you're staying.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Since Bill died... I keep expecting to see Bill at the fire. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"I sharpen sticks down to nothing. It doesn't bring anyone back. It just keeps my hands from shaking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"Nobody says Bill's name right yet. We will. Give it a few days.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "You show them Wild Ramps — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"I asked Bill about this wound — Bill's gone. Still need hands. Are you in?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"It's getting worse, not better. If it festers I'm no good to anyone — can't haul, can't hunt, can't watch. Just clean it out and wrap it tight.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"The water bulges — a ripple with intent. That's The Anaconda Empress telling you it's about to move. It hunts at night — give the dark a wide berth.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"I dreamed Bill was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "You show them Wild Ramps — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"I keep turning over the last thing Bill said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"The fire feels smaller without Bill. The rest of us will have to be bigger.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"Alright. Catch you later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 38,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 42,
   "text": "\"We never finished talking about what's been happening — we left it mid-thought, 4 days back. 'A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be.' We all learn.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 42,
   "text": "\"Walk with me? I want another pair of eyes on something.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 42,
   "text": "It's quiet at the tree line. Autumn doesn't say much. Sometimes that's the whole point."
  },
  {
   "day": 42,
   "text": "\"I listen to everyone and nod. It's a strategy. Probably.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 42,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 42,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 42,
   "text": "You show them Serviceberry — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 42,
   "text": "\"I could talk all day, but — go on. We'll talk more.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 42,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 42,
   "text": "\"Good — what's been happening, settled. Feels better said out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 42,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 42,
   "text": "\"Never mind this wound — we got it handled. Thanks anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 42,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 42,
   "text": "\"a burned farmhouse — I'll show you on the map sometime. It's real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 42,
   "text": "\"No, really — it's handled. Thanks for asking, though.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 42,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 42,
   "text": "They fill the quiet. \"Anyway — where was I?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 42,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Hey — I found some Serviceberry today. You were right, it was right where you said.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Still on that plant lesson.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up? You'll see.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"Have you seen the sick row? 3 down with a hot angry fever. Nobody says it out loud but everyone's counting.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "They nod. \"Okay.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"That's the whole of it. Sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"I wish we had longer. Soon, yeah?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Between us — We never did finish talking about that favor — that was 8 days back. Still on your mind? 'They fill the quiet. Anyway — where was I?' We still owe what's been happening a proper ending, too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"It's my sister, Malak. Was taken at the Scattering. The boring half, they said — my sister, boring. I think about that every day. The pods get into my sleep some nights."
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "Row on row of them, humming like a held note -- and I wake up reaching for something that isn't there."
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"3 of us are down with a hot angry fever. Boil everything. I mean everything.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"That's... pretty much all of it, honestly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"When's the last time you really laughed?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Stealing joy. I like that. We should steal more of it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Thanks for listening. Most people change the subject.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 50,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  }
 ],
